  'If Pantry is steering':'如果粮仓在偏袒','catch {0} in 100':'100次里发现{0}次','If Pantry is fair':'如果粮仓是公平的','false alarm {0} in 100':'100次里误报{0}次',
  'Alarm line: {line} steered orders out of {n} · answer in {days} days':'警报线：{n}份里有{line}份偏袒订单 · {days}天出结果',
